0,Siouan languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siouan-Catawban_languages,"January 1, 2026 - Siouan (/ˈsuːən/ SOO-ən), also known as Siouan–Catawban (/ˌsuːən kəˈtɔː.bən/ SOO-ən kə-TAW-bən), is a language family of North America located primarily in the Great Plains, Ohio and Mississippi valleys and southeastern North America with a few other languages in the east.",Osage,Siouan-Catawban
